target: internal/record/record.go
verify: go test ./internal/record/ -count=1 -run 'TestStorePath'
expect: the_default_is_the_skill
why:    the default is runlog.STORE's default, character for character. Any other path reads an empty or absent store whenever REVIEW_LOOP_RUNS is unset — which is the normal case — and every run then derives `unknown`, so the gate discloses instead of deciding and nothing looks broken.
--- old
		p = "~/.claude/review-loop/runs.jsonl"--- new
		p = "~/.claude/looper/runs.jsonl"